{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If she tries anything shady or attempts to hurt you, push that button right in front of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It will execute her instantly.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030980/extras/bcf73c21f35ce4e91532106690b0c3a7.poster.avif?t=1768314571\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030980/extras/bcf73c21f35ce4e91532106690b0c3a7.webm?t=1768314571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030980/extras/bcf73c21f35ce4e91532106690b0c3a7.mp4?t=1768314571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough takes about 5 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The basic controls are click-only.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The red \u201cExecution Button\u201d placed right in front of you can be pressed at any time\u2014even in the middle of a conversation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on <strong>whether you press it or not</strong>, <strong>when you press it</strong>, and <strong>the choices you make</strong>, the story changes. Driven by the player\u2019s decisions, curiosity, and guilt, it branches into <strong>13 different endings</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remake Additions &amp; Enhancements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is a remake of the free game <i>Itsukano Yoru</i>, originally released on Unityroom in October 2023.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full voice acting for \u201cMira\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional endings, along with new BGM, CG illustrations, and character sprite variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added Gallery feature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports English and Chinese (Traditional / Simplified)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Voice Cast</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mira: Nako Natsuki </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Programming &amp; Scenario: Indigo Ingots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art: polaritia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds: Kazura's MUSIC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When streaming, please include the game title and the URL of this page in the summary field.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3030980?t=1768314571","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030980/1713eb3e136c5f80d73d7d52e2a63673f3e38cfb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768314571","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030980/79f34332f6b1e6cfa94d344d0eaf96593bd01367/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768314571","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030980/79f34332f6b1e6cfa94d344d0eaf96593bd01367/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768314571","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The story in this game takes place in a fantasy world.\r\nYou can execute a dragon girl suspected of a crime at any time if she is about to harm you.\r\n\r\nIt does not contain bleeding, violence or sexual content."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3208700,"description":""}],"detailed_descri